.MARINE...
(Today through Monday)
Issued at 1102 AM PDT Wed Sep 2 2026

The light northwesterly breezes will continue through the week
with occasional moderate gusts and slight to moderate wind driven
seas. Diurnal winds gradually increase Friday afternoon, and once
again Saturday especially in vicinity of Monterey Bay. Tropical
cyclone activity will produce long period southerly swell for
Friday through the weekend.

